    {
      "id": "p1",
      "label": "Paragraph 1 · Meet ELSA",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p1a",
          "parts": [
            "Hello.",
            "I’m an ELSA."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1b",
          "parts": [
            "My full, official name is",
            "Experimental Live-in",
            "Service Apparatus."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1c",
          "parts": [
            "I am what people in the past",
            "used to call",
            "a domestic robot."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1d",
          "parts": [
            "My owner,",
            "who is a female human,",
            "calls me Elsa,",
            "like the girl’s name."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1e",
          "parts": [
            "I’m a modern ELSA,",
            "which means that a)",
            "I look a lot like",
            "a human being,"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1f",
          "parts": [
            "b) I have a very big memory",
            "and a lot of computing power,",
            "which allows me to do",
            "a lot of very complicated jobs,"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1g",
          "parts": [
            "and c) my computer can “grow”",
            "through a series of upgrades."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p1h",
          "parts": [
            "To put it in other words,",
            "I can learn how to do",
            "new things."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "label": "Paragraph 2 · A new voice",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p2a",
          "parts": [
            "Recently, my owner paid for me",
            "to have a language upgrade",
            "to improve the way I speak."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2b",
          "parts": [
            "Now, I speak less like a robot",
            "and more like a human."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2c",
          "parts": [
            "For example, I always used to say",
            "“I do not” instead of “I don’t”",
            "or “they are” instead of “they’re”."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2d",
          "parts": [
            "This made my voice sound",
            "very formal",
            "and kind of boring."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2e",
          "parts": [
            "Now I use contractions",
            "all the time,",
            "and the result is that my voice",
            "now sounds more natural—",
            "much more like a human voice."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
